# de-warehouse
A local data engineering project for building and testing a PostgresSQL-based data warehouse using Docker.

## Prerequisites

-Docker Desktop
-Git
-GNU Make

## How to run

1. Copy the example environment file:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
make up
docker compose ps
```
Run:
docker compose up -d
docker compose ps
http://localhost:5050
add the new server and enter my username and password
